						<div class="sc-nav__dropdown-inner">

							
<ul class="sc-visit-hub__list sc-visit-hub__list--compact" role="list">
		<li class="sc-visit-hub__item" role="listitem">
			<button type="button"
				class="sc-visit-hub__question"
				id="vqhub-nav-q-d5fc091432a84aa38bfe542ba4093e52"
				aria-expanded="false"
				aria-controls="vqhub-nav-a-d5fc091432a84aa38bfe542ba4093e52">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__icon" aria-hidden="true">schedule</span>
				<span class="sc-visit-hub__question-text">What are SkyCity Auckland&#x27;s opening hours?</span>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__chevron" aria-hidden="true">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
			</button>
			<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer"
				id="vqhub-nav-a-d5fc091432a84aa38bfe542ba4093e52"
				role="region"
				aria-labelledby="vqhub-nav-q-d5fc091432a84aa38bfe542ba4093e52"
				hidden>
					<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer-body"><p>The casino is open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Restaurant, bar, and attraction hours vary by venue and season — check the relevant venue or Sky Tower page for current times.</p></div>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="sc-visit-hub__item" role="listitem">
			<button type="button"
				class="sc-visit-hub__question"
				id="vqhub-nav-q-1e63e89d030543bfbc24ed2cdd6064f7"
				aria-expanded="false"
				aria-controls="vqhub-nav-a-1e63e89d030543bfbc24ed2cdd6064f7">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__icon" aria-hidden="true">location_on</span>
				<span class="sc-visit-hub__question-text">How do I get to SkyCity Auckland?</span>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__chevron" aria-hidden="true">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
			</button>
			<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer"
				id="vqhub-nav-a-1e63e89d030543bfbc24ed2cdd6064f7"
				role="region"
				aria-labelledby="vqhub-nav-q-1e63e89d030543bfbc24ed2cdd6064f7"
				hidden>
					<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer-body"><p>Te Waihorotiu Station (Albert Street) is on the door-step of SkyCity, and there are also several bus routes stopping nearby along Albert, Wellesley and Queen Streets. By car, it's easily reached from Auckland's motorway network - from the Southern Motorway, exit at Nelson Street and follow the signs to SkyCity. Auckland Airport is around 20–30 minutes away.</p></div>
					<a href="/about-us/getting-to-and-from/" class="sc-visit-hub__cta">
						Directions &amp; transport
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
					</a>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="sc-visit-hub__item" role="listitem">
			<button type="button"
				class="sc-visit-hub__question"
				id="vqhub-nav-q-0776ea3186644ae7a821ec12dc326a20"
				aria-expanded="false"
				aria-controls="vqhub-nav-a-0776ea3186644ae7a821ec12dc326a20">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__icon" aria-hidden="true">local_parking</span>
				<span class="sc-visit-hub__question-text">What are your casual parking rates?</span>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__chevron" aria-hidden="true">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
			</button>
			<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer"
				id="vqhub-nav-a-0776ea3186644ae7a821ec12dc326a20"
				role="region"
				aria-labelledby="vqhub-nav-q-0776ea3186644ae7a821ec12dc326a20"
				hidden>
					<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer-body"><p>Our current casual, Super Saver and Early Bird rates for both the SkyCity Main Car Park and the NZICC &amp; Horizon by SkyCity Car Park are set out in the <a target="" data-router-slot="disabled" href="/about-us/car-parking/" title="Car Parking">parking rates table</a>.</p></div>
					<a href="/about-us/car-parking/" class="sc-visit-hub__cta">
						Full parking info
						<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span>
					</a>
			</div>
		</li>
		<li class="sc-visit-hub__item" role="listitem">
			<button type="button"
				class="sc-visit-hub__question"
				id="vqhub-nav-q-c66ca915f4bd4c25a8a3bdad168a26d4"
				aria-expanded="false"
				aria-controls="vqhub-nav-a-c66ca915f4bd4c25a8a3bdad168a26d4">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__icon" aria-hidden="true">checkroom</span>
				<span class="sc-visit-hub__question-text">What is the dress code?</span>
				<span class="material-symbols-outlined sc-visit-hub__chevron" aria-hidden="true">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
			</button>
			<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer"
				id="vqhub-nav-a-c66ca915f4bd4c25a8a3bdad168a26d4"
				role="region"
				aria-labelledby="vqhub-nav-q-c66ca915f4bd4c25a8a3bdad168a26d4"
				hidden>
					<div class="sc-visit-hub__answer-body"><p>At SkyCity, we are proud to provide you with a world-class environment to enjoy. We require a neat and tidy standard of dress at all times. The following items are not appropriate:</p><ul><li><p>Torn or damaged clothing (except fashionably distressed items)</p></li><li><p>Dirty clothing or footwear</p></li><li><p>Safety or trade clothing (e.g. safety vests)</p></li><li><p>Sleeveless tops on men</p></li><li><p>Gang patches or insignia</p></li><li><p>Hats or caps (except for religious or medical reasons or within the Poker Zone)</p></li><li><p>Sunglasses (except within the Poker Zone)</p></li></ul><p>SkyCity reserves the right to refuse entry where patrons are not appropriately dressed.</p></div>
			</div>
		</li>
</ul>


							<div class="sc-nav__dropdown-footer">
