	<section class="sc-section sc-skytower-intro" id="overview" aria-labelledby="sc-overview-heading">
		<div class="sc-container">
			<div class="sc-skytower-overview">
				<div class="sc-skytower-overview__content">
					<h2 class="sr-only" id="sc-overview-heading">About Sky Tower</h2>

						<div class="sc-prose sc-skytower-overview__body">
							<h3>Standing 328 metres above Auckland, the Sky Tower has dominated the Tāmaki Makaurau skyline for over 29 years.</h3><p>From 186 metres above street level, enjoy panoramic 360° views stretching up to 80 kilometres in every direction — spot the city's 53 volcanoes, the Hauraki Gulf islands, and landmarks across Tāmaki Makaurau.</p><h3>Admission Options</h3><h4>Sky Tower Admission</h4><p>Access Main Observation Deck (186m), The Lookout (194m), and *SkyBar (182m).</p><p>*SkyBar is an R18+ licensed venue open from 11am daily. Valid photo ID may be required</p><h4>Sky Tower Admission plus Sky Deck</h4><p>Access all of the above, plus the Sky Deck (220m) — New Zealand's highest viewing deck.</p><p>Tickets are valid for six months from purchase. All children must be accompanied by an adult. SkyBar is R18+ only – valid photo ID required.</p><p>Join the Sky Tower whānau and experience the best views all year round. Pass holders enjoy 15% off the Sky Tower Gift Shop (excluding alcohol, max $50), 20% off SkyWalk, SkyRide, SkyBar, All Blacks Experience, and Wētā Workshop Unleashed, and 25% off Magic Memories souvenir photos.</p>
						</div>
